window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They're not just going to share me. They're going to breed me.</b></p> <p>When two dragon shifters decided I was their mate, they didn't ask. They just chased me down, tore my panties off, and spanked my bare ass until I was ready to come like a good girl for them.</p> <p>These ancient beasts aren't just going to carry me off and ravage me thoroughly. They're going to claim me, share me, and make me theirs in the most shameful ways imaginable.</p> <p>Then they're going to put a baby in me.</p> <p>Shared <i>is a standalone romance and the second book in the Bonded Mates series. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
